Package: italymapping
Type: Package
Title: Italy Mapping
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = c("Marco", "Aurelio"), family = "Ramirez Mauricio",
    email = "114740853+MarcoRMz95@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible shaded-relief maps of Italian regions, with municipal
    boundaries, rivers, coastlines and English annotations. Includes national GIS
    data and four ready-to-run regional examples. Map generation is offline
    and preserves the native information content of the supplied elevation grid.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: sf, terra, ggplot2, ragg, ggspatial, scales
Suggests: jsonlite, curl, remotes, zip
URL: https://github.com/MarcoRMz95/Italy-mapping
BugReports: https://github.com/MarcoRMz95/Italy-mapping/issues
